  m_Name: Blade6
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  partName: Rear Blade Shroud Upper
  description: The Rear Blade Shroud Upper is a ring-like component that surrounds
    the Rear Blade Upper, providing a seal between the blade and the engine casing
    to prevent gas leaks and maintain pressure. Made from a high-temperature resistant
    material, it is designed to withstand the extreme conditions found at the rear
    of the engine. Its design is often more complex than the other shrouds, due to
    the unique shape and position of the Rear Blade Upper.
